WEBVTT

00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:07.800
Furuya-kun!

00:00:08.460 --> 00:00:09.530
So it has come to this...

00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:12.390
Shouldn't we make it clear?

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:16.990
Don't you agree, Furuya?!

00:01:53.920 --> 00:01:56.220
Green is a healing colour.

00:01:56.630 --> 00:02:00.260
Furuya-sama, we sincerely welcome you here.

00:02:00.260 --> 00:02:02.220
Here is your welcome drink.

00:02:04.430 --> 00:02:07.850
I am really thirsty right now!

00:02:09.350 --> 00:02:11.360
Now's not the time to talk like that!

00:02:12.940 --> 00:02:14.730
Please take your time.

00:02:17.150 --> 00:02:18.950
Untie me!

00:02:18.950 --> 00:02:20.200
Hey!

00:02:22.580 --> 00:02:24.620
Hey, wai-

00:02:26.500 --> 00:02:28.370
Is this for real?!

00:02:28.370 --> 00:02:31.210
Hey, stop messing around.

00:02:31.210 --> 00:02:33.630
This could be considered an abduction.

00:02:33.630 --> 00:02:35.250
This is kidnapping and confinement!

00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:36.210
Are you listening?

00:02:36.210 --> 00:02:37.210
I told you to untie me!

00:02:37.210 --> 00:02:39.180
What are you going to do if my back starts to itch?

00:02:39.180 --> 00:02:40.890
My back is starting to itch.

00:02:40.890 --> 00:02:43.680
Really, really itchy!

00:02:44.470 --> 00:02:46.560
Okay. So now you've come back.

00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:48.980
Shut up.

00:02:48.980 --> 00:02:51.600
I can hear you all the way from the corridor.

00:02:53.190 --> 00:02:54.610
Who are you?

00:02:54.610 --> 00:02:59.610
People keep coming to my house, and they're all so rude.

00:02:59.610 --> 00:03:02.110
It's not like I wanted to come here.

00:03:02.570 --> 00:03:03.910
I guess so.

00:03:07.580 --> 00:03:11.920
I am Sanka Danichirou's wife, Sanka Aria.

00:03:12.920 --> 00:03:14.250
So, you are Rea's...

00:03:14.710 --> 00:03:17.880
You are Furuya Chihiro-kun?

00:03:18.420 --> 00:03:21.010
You take care of Rea, right?

00:03:21.010 --> 00:03:23.840
No, "take care of" is a bit...

00:03:24.680 --> 00:03:26.060
So?

00:03:26.060 --> 00:03:28.180
How far have you two gone?

00:03:28.930 --> 00:03:29.390
Eh?

00:03:30.870 --> 00:03:32.940
Still at the kissing stage?

00:03:32.940 --> 00:03:37.480
Since that girl has suppressed her feelings until now,

00:03:37.480 --> 00:03:40.150
she must have become wild and sexual.

00:03:41.030 --> 00:03:42.530
W-What are you talking about?

00:03:42.530 --> 00:03:43.660
There's no way Rea would...

00:03:43.990 --> 00:03:44.960
Oh.

00:03:44.960 --> 00:03:48.790
So you still haven't...

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:52.330
I see.

00:03:52.330 --> 00:03:55.540
Well, she <i>is</i> a monster.

00:03:56.710 --> 00:04:03.470
Zombies will rot and start smelling, right?

00:04:04.220 --> 00:04:06.720
Her skin will also become more and more dirty...

00:04:12.100 --> 00:04:15.350
How can you say something like this about the daughter whom you've given birth to?

00:04:15.810 --> 00:04:17.010
Given birth to?

00:04:17.010 --> 00:04:18.570
Me?

00:04:18.570 --> 00:04:19.640
No.

00:04:19.640 --> 00:04:23.990
I have never given birth before.

00:04:23.990 --> 00:04:25.110
What does that mean?

00:04:25.820 --> 00:04:27.620
If so, you are...

00:04:28.030 --> 00:04:32.040
I am Danichirou-san's second wife.

00:04:33.460 --> 00:04:34.620
Yes.

00:04:34.620 --> 00:04:38.090
That girl is the child of his former wife.

00:04:38.090 --> 00:04:41.560
She's not related to me by blood in any way.

00:04:41.560 --> 00:04:43.880
Rea hasn't told me anything about this.

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:45.680
Of course.

00:04:45.680 --> 00:04:49.010
This is the biggest taboo of the Sanka Family.

00:04:49.010 --> 00:04:51.310
Only very few people know about this.

00:04:53.180 --> 00:04:55.190
Since I have the opportunity, I will tell you this.

00:04:55.190 --> 00:04:58.810
I was originally a maid in the Sanka Family.

00:04:59.690 --> 00:05:03.740
Even so, don't get the wrong idea, and think that I was low class.

00:05:04.900 --> 00:05:15.000
Before Rea was born, all the maids working in this house were prospective wives of the Sanka Family's successor.

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:19.210
Family class, education levels, even their personalities...

00:05:19.210 --> 00:05:25.010
Only people who qualified in all these areas could work inside the house.

00:05:27.510 --> 00:05:31.140
I guess there's no chance of putting a picture of her up here.

00:05:33.060 --> 00:05:37.140
Therefore, from now on, let's put up a picture of me.

00:05:43.440 --> 00:05:47.070
Since Danichirou-san was little, many maids had tried to please him...

00:05:47.070 --> 00:05:51.950
...so they could become a member of the Sanka Family.

00:05:53.540 --> 00:05:57.500
However, Danichirou-san never showed interest in any of them.

00:06:02.420 --> 00:06:05.060
By the time I came here as a maid,

00:06:05.060 --> 00:06:08.090
Danichirou-san was studying in college.

00:06:09.800 --> 00:06:13.720
Even though you have worked hard to
become a maid of the Sanka Family, it is a pity.

00:06:13.720 --> 00:06:16.520
The current successor has no interest in women.

00:06:17.520 --> 00:06:19.600
You will also be kept like a useless pet until you die.

00:06:21.560 --> 00:06:24.670
It's not like he has no interest in women,

00:06:24.670 --> 00:06:26.690
but rather, he isn't interested in any of you.

00:06:32.740 --> 00:06:37.960
I was confident, since there hasn't been a man who didn't fall for me.

00:06:52.010 --> 00:06:53.350
Come in.

00:07:06.190 --> 00:07:08.240
How did you know that I wanted coffee?

00:07:09.150 --> 00:07:11.490
I thought it was about time that you would finish your drink.

00:07:11.490 --> 00:07:13.530
I have also brought the lap blanket.

00:07:14.910 --> 00:07:15.950
What's your name?

00:07:16.910 --> 00:07:18.950
I am Aria.

00:07:29.920 --> 00:07:33.840
I got called to Danichirou-san's side regularly.

00:08:05.830 --> 00:08:09.630
However, in the end, Danichirou-san didn't fall for me.

00:08:16.510 --> 00:08:19.180
Good morning, Danichirou-sama.

00:08:21.390 --> 00:08:27.230
I slowly started to think that
Danichirou-san was not interested in women.

00:08:29.320 --> 00:08:32.610
However, the situation changed drastically.

00:08:36.950 --> 00:08:39.490
On that day, treating it as a social welfare event,

00:08:39.490 --> 00:08:46.250
the Sanka Family invited people with disabilities and people from the neighbourhood to the fencing tournament.

00:08:48.460 --> 00:08:51.460
Of course, Danichirou-san was one of the participants.

00:08:59.760 --> 00:09:01.560
Danichirou-sama has won.

00:09:01.560 --> 00:09:03.810
Danichirou-sama is fantastic!

00:09:14.320 --> 00:09:16.240
That was a good fight.

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:23.450
Why didn't you fight me seriously?

00:09:23.450 --> 00:09:25.620
Did you think I would lose?

00:09:26.670 --> 00:09:30.790
The Sanka Family has given a lot of money to the International Fencing Federation.

00:09:30.790 --> 00:09:33.130
In other words, they are the biggest sponsor.

00:09:33.480 --> 00:09:39.260
It was decided beforehand that Danichirou-san would win this annually held tournament.

00:09:39.260 --> 00:09:42.060
Since Danichirou-san was not someone who could read the atmosphere,

00:09:42.060 --> 00:09:44.890
he didn't seem to like the fact that the game was set up.

00:09:47.330 --> 00:09:50.650
When the tournament was over, and the visitors were leaving,

00:09:51.770 --> 00:09:54.800
that girl called out to Danichirou-san.

00:09:55.700 --> 00:09:56.760
Excuse me.

00:09:58.700 --> 00:09:59.780
Here...

00:10:05.450 --> 00:10:08.420
You must be dissatisfied with today's match.

00:10:09.830 --> 00:10:13.670
However, if you don't treat it with respect, God will be angry with you.

00:10:16.010 --> 00:10:19.180
Even though the outcome of today's tournament was fixed,

00:10:19.180 --> 00:10:21.490
please don't behave this way,

00:10:21.490 --> 00:10:24.560
especially since your practice and hard work were real.

00:10:32.900 --> 00:10:34.820
A few days later,

00:10:38.860 --> 00:10:43.660
Danichirou-san proposed to that 15-year-old girl.

00:10:46.200 --> 00:10:48.410
Since the start of the Sanka Family, that event was the most shocking.

00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:54.680
He ignored us and chose a frail little girl,

00:10:54.680 --> 00:10:57.420
whose lineage was unknown...

00:10:58.130 --> 00:11:01.140
That's Rea's real mother...

00:11:04.890 --> 00:11:10.440
Of course, such a marriage was disputed by all the members of the Sanka family.

00:11:11.690 --> 00:11:15.610
But Danichirou-san did not listen to his family's wishes.

00:11:16.440 --> 00:11:18.110
You said her lineage is the problem?

00:11:18.570 --> 00:11:19.990
Of course!

00:11:19.990 --> 00:11:21.860
A girl of unknown origin...

00:11:22.200 --> 00:11:25.320
If so, I'll give up the headship of the family.

00:11:25.320 --> 00:11:27.870
Then there won't be anything preventing me from marrying her.

00:11:29.370 --> 00:11:31.460
What are you saying, Danichirou?

00:11:31.460 --> 00:11:33.170
Don't be stupid!

00:11:33.170 --> 00:11:35.920
How can you abandon the Sanka Family for a girl like that?!

00:11:36.280 --> 00:11:38.340
A girl like that?

00:11:38.760 --> 00:11:41.050
Watch your words, please.

00:11:41.050 --> 00:11:43.780
This woman is going to be my wife.

00:11:43.780 --> 00:11:46.760
After I have thrown away the name of Sanka,

00:11:46.760 --> 00:11:48.770
you will be nothing but strangers.

00:11:48.770 --> 00:11:53.350
Let me make it clear: I can't stand people bad-mouthing my wife.

00:11:56.610 --> 00:12:01.860
Danichirou-san shut his relatives up, and married that woman.

00:12:06.160 --> 00:12:10.250
But, right after she gave birth to Rea, that woman died.

00:12:23.930 --> 00:12:27.220
Danichirou-san was heartbroken,

00:12:28.150 --> 00:12:30.980
to the point where we thought he would die as well.

00:12:35.850 --> 00:12:38.630
But I supported him to the best of my ability,

00:12:38.630 --> 00:12:40.690
and he gradually recovered.

00:13:14.270 --> 00:13:18.270
And then Danichirou-san finally became mine.

00:13:27.610 --> 00:13:31.950
But, after our wedding, one year passed, then two,

00:13:31.950 --> 00:13:36.040
and even now, he still hasn't taken me.

00:13:36.040 --> 00:13:38.630
What do you mean...?

00:13:38.630 --> 00:13:40.910
You are very thick.

00:13:40.910 --> 00:13:42.710
I mean he has never made love to me.

00:13:44.340 --> 00:13:50.530
Danichirou-san just thought that the girl needed a mother.

00:13:50.530 --> 00:13:54.390
However, in reality, not even a mother was needed.

00:13:55.430 --> 00:13:58.020
There was nothing for me to do.

00:14:07.110 --> 00:14:10.820
I just looked at them from a distance.

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:14.370
They never let me feel as if I'm part of the family.

00:14:24.000 --> 00:14:25.320
What's the problem?

00:14:25.320 --> 00:14:27.920
How about we travel sometime?

00:14:29.800 --> 00:14:34.680
Thinking back, we never went on a honeymoon.

00:14:35.890 --> 00:14:37.680
Right.

00:14:38.480 --> 00:14:43.240
It might be good for Rea to experience the outside world.

00:14:43.240 --> 00:14:44.980
Are we bringing Rea?

00:14:44.980 --> 00:14:46.440
What are you saying?

00:14:51.990 --> 00:14:58.580
Even so, I still believe there was love
since he chose me as his second wife.

00:15:15.430 --> 00:15:20.310
Mother, let's take a photo with Father.

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:22.940
Okay.

00:15:26.440 --> 00:15:31.950
I believed that his love for the girl was the same as that of a father and daughter.

00:15:33.240 --> 00:15:34.450
But...

00:15:41.580 --> 00:15:45.840
I've come as you told me, but what're you up to?

00:15:48.920 --> 00:15:50.590
What are you doing?

00:15:50.590 --> 00:15:54.430
I think you should give up, Aria-sama.

00:15:54.800 --> 00:15:55.680
Huh?

00:15:56.510 --> 00:16:02.070
I would like you to stop asking Danichirou-sama for his love.

00:16:02.070 --> 00:16:03.690
What are you talking-

00:16:05.980 --> 00:16:10.320
Please do not speak loudly.

00:16:27.670 --> 00:16:29.920
Now, the pose is like this.

00:16:29.920 --> 00:16:32.130
Raise your leg this way...

00:16:32.130 --> 00:16:33.310
Yes.

00:16:38.390 --> 00:16:41.480
Would you give up?

00:17:04.830 --> 00:17:12.760
After all, since Danichirou-san is still chasing remnants of that woman, he continues to dote on that girl.

00:17:14.130 --> 00:17:17.010
"That girl" is my daughter?

00:17:17.890 --> 00:17:20.510
Don't say something so disgusting.

00:17:21.430 --> 00:17:26.520
It seems it wasn't just her father's fault that Rea was cornered.

00:17:31.570 --> 00:17:33.940
Hey, Furuya-kun.

00:17:33.940 --> 00:17:37.490
Don't you think that I'm a pitiful woman?

00:17:38.820 --> 00:17:42.200
Won't you comfort me with your body?

00:17:44.250 --> 00:17:48.420
Hey, it's the warmth that a zombie can't give you, isn't it?

00:18:01.720 --> 00:18:06.700
Sorry, I'm only interested in zombie girls.

00:18:13.940 --> 00:18:15.990
Everybody looks at the girl...

00:18:15.990 --> 00:18:19.990
Why does nobody look at me?!

00:18:30.250 --> 00:18:36.340
Ah, kitty, are you going to comfort me?

00:18:37.380 --> 00:18:39.220
A woman like myself...

00:18:42.100 --> 00:18:44.930
Dear, gentle kitty.

00:18:45.430 --> 00:18:47.060
It's also a zombie.

00:18:50.560 --> 00:18:55.400
Someone get these two insolent things out of the mansion!

00:18:56.110 --> 00:18:59.030
I would also prefer to leave this place if I could.

00:18:59.530 --> 00:19:01.910
I can't let that happen.

00:19:03.410 --> 00:19:05.950
Danichirou-sama is calling you.

00:19:06.450 --> 00:19:11.580
Hey, like I said before, this is an actual kidnapping.

00:19:11.580 --> 00:19:15.380
I don't care if Danichirou-sama is the head of the Sanka family.

00:19:15.380 --> 00:19:18.970
You don't have the right to treat me like this.

00:19:20.720 --> 00:19:24.140
So, won't you untie me at least?

00:19:24.490 --> 00:19:25.560
I can't.

00:19:26.890 --> 00:19:28.610
As I thought...

00:19:28.610 --> 00:19:29.940
Isn't it good?

00:19:29.940 --> 00:19:31.410
I envy you.

00:19:32.600 --> 00:19:35.320
You can be his companion.

00:19:36.900 --> 00:19:38.450
On the other hand, I...

00:19:39.110 --> 00:19:42.610
...have never been taken seriously as his companion, not even once.

00:19:58.920 --> 00:20:00.550
What has happened?

00:20:05.720 --> 00:20:10.430
C-Could you turn the air conditioning up?

00:20:10.790 --> 00:20:11.980
Okay.

00:20:13.850 --> 00:20:16.310
Is it that hot today?

00:20:16.930 --> 00:20:18.360
I'm sure of it.

00:20:18.360 --> 00:20:21.920
The people I just saw are henchmen that my father sent.

00:20:21.920 --> 00:20:23.820
Furuya-kun must be in danger.

00:20:24.610 --> 00:20:25.780
Excuse me.

00:20:25.780 --> 00:20:27.780
Could you hurry up?

00:20:27.780 --> 00:20:29.480
Sure.

00:20:31.200 --> 00:20:34.420
I wonder if this girl has money...

00:20:40.880 --> 00:20:42.670
Please wait here.

00:20:42.670 --> 00:20:45.840
Hey, isn't Danichirou-sama calling?

00:20:46.470 --> 00:20:49.060
So, please wait.

00:20:50.970 --> 00:20:52.180
Hey!

00:21:11.750 --> 00:21:14.250
All of them were taken by me.

00:21:15.620 --> 00:21:17.250
Here he comes.

00:21:17.540 --> 00:21:22.260
No matter what moment, Rea is beautiful.

00:21:23.010 --> 00:21:27.350
Because she is woven with delicacy and beauty,

00:21:27.350 --> 00:21:29.260
she is nothing but purity itself.

00:21:30.470 --> 00:21:33.770
I have continued protecting Rea's purity.

00:21:35.640 --> 00:21:38.560
I am grateful to you.

00:21:40.520 --> 00:21:44.530
Losing Rea once has intensified my love for her,

00:21:45.040 --> 00:21:50.530
and has made me want to protect her even more.

00:21:54.950 --> 00:21:56.330
Thank you.

00:21:57.840 --> 00:21:59.540
Thank you.

00:22:00.030 --> 00:22:04.550
But I won't forgive you, Furuya Chihiro.

00:23:42.400 --> 00:23:47.820
Hey, you. Because work is work, it's bad to sulk or brood.

00:23:48.900 --> 00:23:51.400
Since you have accepted this, you should do your best.

00:23:51.400 --> 00:23:52.450
Got it?

00:23:53.280 --> 00:23:53.870
Here we go.

00:23:54.700 --> 00:23:55.910
Next time, Sankarea.

00:23:55.910 --> 00:24:00.660
Episode 11: It's... Nothing Special...

00:24:00.660 --> 00:24:03.040
You should quit if you don't have the will to do it.

00:24:04.540 --> 00:24:06.670
Say it , "Everyone better watch it! Mero~"
